# What `composer create-project` and a release archive leave out.
#
# Only what belongs to this repository rather than to an application built from
# it. tests/, the tool configuration and docs/ stay: an application keeps
# `composer check`, autoload-dev scans tests/Fixtures/ and fails without it, and
# README.md links into docs/.
/.github        export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/CHANGELOG.md   export-ignore
/STABILITY.md   export-ignore
/UPGRADING.md   export-ignore
/LICENSE        export-ignore
